body: "Source: [GitHub issue 1485](https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1485).\n\nThe report links the public pm-web capacity harness and unbraind/pm-web issue 211. It separates three untraced and three traced runs, pre-append delay, index-lock wait lower bound, downstream SDK classification, polling and SSE delivery. The proposed investigation must retain those distinctions and must not infer universal starvation from one perturbed run. This PR records intake only; implementation remains unclaimed."
